sequenceDiagram
    participant Editor as Web editor
    participant API as Leafrun API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Git as Git module / Gitea
    Editor->>API: Files, base_commit, operation_id
    API->>DB: Check role, quota, operation
    API->>Git: Prepare commit + check tip
    alt base_commit matches
        Git->>Git: CAS
        Git-->>API: commit_sha
        API->>DB: Finalize operation, quota and audit
        API-->>Editor: Saved: new SHA
        Editor->>API: Create render for this SHA
        API-->>Editor: 202, render_id and status
    else Another editor changed the branch
        Git-->>API: source_conflict, current_sha
        API->>DB: Record conflict + release quota
        API-->>Editor: 409: compare + retry
    end
    Note over API,Git: Recover using operation_id
    Note over Editor,API: External Git is read-only
